@* IzzyTheme's Overview, written by hand: presets, brand colors (built-in and hex), the rest of the
   settings as code and the color scheme. The Theming articles have the detail;
   this page points to them. Accessibility and See also come from the doc comment. *@

<Heading Level="2">Usage</Heading>
<Code Block Language="razor" Title="App.razor">@Usage</Code>
<TextBlock>A theme is the app's colors, shape, spacing and fonts; to set it, put one IzzyTheme in the <Code>head</Code>. It sets the theme on the server, so the theme is in place on first paint, <Anchor Href="docs/common/render-modes">with JavaScript off</Anchor> too, in every render mode. <Anchor Href="docs/theming/themes">Themes and presets</Anchor> covers each setting.</TextBlock>

<Heading Level="2">Presets</Heading>
<TextBlock>A preset sets the starting density, shape and type: <Code>Standard</Code> (the default), <Code>Compact</Code>, <Code>Soft</Code> or <Code>Editorial</Code>. Set <Code>Preset</Code> to choose one. A setting you set yourself overrides the preset's value.</TextBlock>
<ExampleViewer Example="izzy-theme-presets" />

<Heading Level="2">Brand color</Heading>
<TextBlock>The brand color is the color of buttons, links and focus rings. Set <Code>Brand</Code> to a built-in name, tuned by hand for light and dark:</TextBlock>
<ExampleViewer Example="izzy-theme-brands" />
<TextBlock>Or set it to a hex color of your own. The server derives four colors from it, in light and dark: a fill, the text on that fill, a shade for text in the brand color that stays readable on the page, and a soft tint.</TextBlock>
<ExampleViewer Example="izzy-theme-hex-brand" />

<Heading Level="2">Grays, shape and fonts</Heading>
<TextBlock>The rest of the theme sets the grays, the shape and spacing, and the fonts:</TextBlock>
<Prose Class="site-table ib-scroll">
    <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Sets</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr><td><Code>Gray</Code></td><td>The page, surfaces and text: <Code>neutral</Code>, <Code>slate</Code>, <Code>stone</Code>, or a hex page color</td></tr>
            <tr><td><Code>Radius</Code>, <Code>Density</Code></td><td>Shape and spacing</td></tr>
            <tr><td><Code>BodyFont</Code>, <Code>HeadingFont</Code>, <Code>MonoFont</Code>, <Code>HeadingWeight</Code></td><td>Type</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>
</Prose>
<Code Block Language="razor">@Settings</Code>
<TextBlock>Inter comes with IzzyBlazor. Load any other font yourself, and end each list with a generic family so text shows while the font loads.</TextBlock>

<Heading Level="2">Light and dark</Heading>
<TextBlock>The color scheme a page starts in is light, dark, or the device's: set <Code>ColorScheme</Code> to choose, or leave it unset to follow the device. A <Anchor Href="docs/components/color-scheme-switch">ColorSchemeSwitch</Anchor> lets the user choose, and their choice overrides this default. <Anchor Href="docs/theming/color-scheme">Light and dark</Anchor> has more.</TextBlock>

<Heading Level="2">Part of a page</Heading>
<TextBlock>To theme only part of a page, such as a dark panel in a light page, use a <Anchor Href="docs/components/theme-scope">ThemeScope</Anchor>. Fonts, <Code>HeadingWeight</Code>, <Code>Scrollbars</Code> and a hex <Code>Gray</Code> are the app's, set here. For one exact value, set its CSS variable, as in <Anchor Href="docs/theming/tokens">Tokens and customizing</Anchor>.</TextBlock>

<Heading Level="2">Mode support</Heading>
<ModeSupportTable Component="Component" ApiComponent="ApiComponent" />

@if (ApiComponent.Accessibility is not null)
{
    <Heading Level="2">Accessibility</Heading>
    <DocHtml Html="@ApiComponent.Accessibility" Context="@(Context with { Overview = true })" Size="ProseSize.Md" />
}

<Heading Level="2">Parameters</Heading>
<ParameterTable ApiComponent="ApiComponent" ApiHref="@Registry.ApiPageHref(Component)" Context="Context" Compact />

<OverviewSeeAlso Component="Component" ApiComponent="ApiComponent" />

@code {
    [Parameter, EditorRequired] public RegistryComponent Component { get; set; } = null!;

    [Parameter, EditorRequired] public ApiComponent ApiComponent { get; set; } = null!;

    [Parameter, EditorRequired] public ApiPageContext Context { get; set; } = null!;

    private const string Usage = """
        <head>
            …
            <link rel="stylesheet" href="@Assets["_content/IzzyBlazor.Core/izzyblazor.css"]" />
            <IzzyTheme Preset="ThemePreset.Compact" Brand="#0a7d5a" />
            <HeadOutlet />
        </head>
        """;

    private const string Settings = """
        <IzzyTheme Brand="indigo" Gray="slate" Radius="ThemeRadius.Lg" Density="ThemeDensity.Compact"
                   BodyFont="'Source Sans 3', system-ui, sans-serif" HeadingWeight="700" />
        """;
}
